# Local-only operator files. These contain operator-specific runtime data,
# personal contacts, or session-specific context that should not be pushed
# to the public repo. Generated/maintained by the operator running the bridge.
# launchd writes bridge.out.log and bridge.err.log (see the LaunchAgent
# plist), so the earlier bridge-stdout/stderr names matched nothing and left
# logs full of message previews one `git add -A` from the public repo.
bridge*.log
# Hand-rolled local launcher; hardcodes the operator vault path. The repo
# ships its own installer at scripts/install-bridge-autostart.sh.
start-bridge.sh
prospect-api/BRIDGE-SPEC-DELTA-*.md
prospect-api/Negotiator Playbook.md
prospect-api/Negotiator Playbook *.md
prospect-api/named-tunnel-cutover.sh
# Generated MCP bundle (uploaded to GitHub Releases, not tracked in git)
*.mcpb
